{"text": "At the end of the tunnel, the boat rushed into a big canal. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The paper got softer and softer, and the boat began to sink. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As he sank, he thought of the dancer, and then a fish swallowed him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later the fish was caught, and a cook cut it open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She found the soldier and carried him back to the same room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was the dancer, still standing on one leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, for no reason, a little boy threw him into the stove. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He felt himself melting, but he still stood firm with his gun. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly a door opened, and the wind blew the dancer into the stove too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning, the maid found a little tin heart in the ashes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of the dancer, only her spangle was left, and it was burned black.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "n", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "u", "n", "n", "e", "l", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "a", "t", " ", "r", "u", "s", "h", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "b", "i", "g", " ", "c", "a", "n", "a", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "p", "e", "r", " ", "g", "o", "t", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", "e", "r", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "o", "f", "t", "e", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "a", "t", " ", "b", "e", "g", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "s", "i", "n", "k", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "s", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "n", "k", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "t", "h", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "e", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", 